From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mtbl23 <mbhangal23@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:04:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add sleeping block entities and hopper transfer caching

Hoppers cache their source and destination containers, skip transfer attempts that are known to fail (inventory change
counters, entity movement trackers) and sleep until something changes; idle furnaces, chests and similar sleep too.
Adapted from Lithium (LGPL-3.0, CaffeineMC, 2No2Name) via the Leaf/Leaves ports, with Paper behaviour kept: cooldown when
full, hopper amount and transfer settings, ignore-occluding-blocks, per-inventory max stack sizes, and the Paper hopper
events (the Paper code path is used when any of them is in play). Switch off with -Dpaper.sleepingBlockEntity=false.

